      "en": "Better change the URL to 'https' before downloading.",
      "noteEn": "The Spanish and official English title attributes are preserved exactly. OCR fused the warning icon into ATENCIÓN, extensively corrupted the deliberately suspicious payload, and added a comma to GUARDAR. The payload is transcribed directly from the Spanish raster and audited as one non-Spanish technical exclusion across four printed lines."
